#: secret_santa/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:3
msgid "🧑‍🎄 Organize a secret gift exchange"
msgstr ""

#: secret_santa/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:4
msgid ""
"Organize a Secret Santa gift exchange (\"Wichteln\") with Nextcloud users "
"and external guests.\n"
"\n"
"- Create lists of participants, both Nextcloud users and guests by name and "
"email\n"
"- Write the email every participant receives\n"
"- Draw the partners and notify every participant by email whom to give a "
"gift\n"
"- Exclude partners, e.g. couples, from drawing each other\n"
"- Import the partners of an earlier draw, so nobody draws the same partner "
"again\n"
"- Archive the lists of past gift exchanges, they are hidden from the "
"navigation and can no longer be changed\n"
"- Share lists with groups to organize the gift exchange together"
msgstr ""

